meta {
  name: hki-review
}

docs {
  # HKI Review API

  ## Endpoints

  | Method | Path | Name |
  |--------|------|------|
  | GET | /api/hki-review/stats | stats |
  | GET | /api/hki-review/all | all |
  | GET | /api/hki-review/ | list |
  | GET | /api/hki-review/:id | get-by-id |
  | POST | /api/hki-review/:id/approve | approve |
  | POST | /api/hki-review/:id/reject | reject |

  ## Auth & Permission
  - Authentication wajib
  - View endpoints: `view_review_hki` atau `manage_hki`
  - Approve/Reject endpoints: `approve_hki`
}
